// that would provide them. Each is work still to be done, not a deliberate
// omission:
//
//   io          print, input, FileHandle, open
//   iter        Iterable, Iterator, enumerate, iter, map, next, zip
//   origin      Origin and the origin-set aliases
//   reflection  reflect
//   builtin     Sized/len, the bin/hex/oct integer formatters, variadics
//
// The string module's codepoint and slice types, and the numeric parsing
// conversions that go with them, exist only in outline so far and join this
// list until they do not.
// =============================================================================
